    {
      "@id": "urn:rose:rule.workflow_integration_boundaries",
      "@type": "rose:BusinessRule",
      "description": "TXNPOST0 executes local PERFORM paragraphs and returns a GL instruction and a cash flag. It does not call GLPOST0, BSACTRO, CTRFIL0 or AUDTLOG0. EODPROC0 calls TXNPOST0 for interest and later AUDTLOG0, but does not consume the GL instruction with POST calls or implement the CTR aggregation claimed by its comment.",
